cff-version: 1.2.0
title: hft-engine
message: >-
  If you refer to this work, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: leeyawnnn
repository-code: "https://github.com/leeyawnnn/high_frequency_trading_engine"
abstract: >-
  A low-latency C++20 market-data-to-order pipeline: a UDP feed handler, a
  flat-array limit order book, a top-of-book imbalance strategy and a
  pre-trade risk gate, connected by lock-free single-producer/single-consumer
  queues and instrumented end to end with the platform cycle counter. Includes
  a decoder for Nasdaq TotalView-ITCH 5.0, a reproducible measurement pipeline
  that records clock resolution and machine provenance with every result, and
  differential, property-based and fuzz testing of the order book.
keywords:
  - cpp20
  - low-latency
  - high-frequency-trading
  - market-data
  - itch
  - lock-free
  - performance-benchmarking
license: Apache-2.0
